      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Judah to Serve Nebuchadnezzar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Early in the reign of Zedekiah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "son of Josiah king of Judah, this word came to Jeremiah from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to me: \"Make a yoke out of straps and crossbars and put it on your neck.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then send word to the kings of Edom, Moab, Ammon, Tyre and Sidon through the envoys who have come to Jerusalem to Zedekiah king of Judah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give them a message for their masters and say, 'This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, the God of Israel, says: \"Tell this to your masters:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With my great power and outstretched arm I made the earth and its people and the animals that are on it, and I give it to anyone I please.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now I will give all your countries into the hands of my servant Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon; I will make even the wild animals subject to him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All nations will serve him and his son and his grandson until the time for his land comes; then many nations and great kings will subjugate him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" ' \"If, however, any nation or kingdom will not serve Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon or bow its neck under his yoke, I will punish that nation with the sword, famine and plague, declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", until I destroy it by his hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So do not listen to your prophets, your diviners, your interpreters of dreams, your mediums or your sorcerers who tell you, 'You will not serve the king of Babylon.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They prophesy lies to you that will only serve to remove you far from your lands; I will banish you and you will perish.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if any nation will bow its neck under the yoke of the king of Babylon and serve him, I will let that nation remain in its own land to till it and to live there, declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".\" ' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I gave the same message to Zedekiah king of Judah. I said, \"Bow your neck under the yoke of the king of Babylon; serve him and his people, and you will live.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why will you and your people die by the sword, famine and plague with which the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has threatened any nation that will not serve the king of Babylon?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not listen to the words of the prophets who say to you, 'You will not serve the king of Babylon,' for they are prophesying lies to you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'I have not sent them,' declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". 'They are prophesying lies in my name. Therefore, I will banish you and you will perish, both you and the prophets who prophesy to you.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I said to the priests and all these people, \"This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: Do not listen to the prophets who say, 'Very soon now the articles from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s house will be brought back from Babylon.' They are prophesying lies to you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not listen to them. Serve the king of Babylon, and you will live. Why should this city become a ruin?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If they are prophets and have the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", let them plead with the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty that the articles remaining in the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and in the palace of the king of Judah and in Jerusalem not be taken to Babylon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty says about the pillars, the bronze Sea, the movable stands and the other articles that are left in this city,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon did not take away when he carried Jehoiachin",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "son of Jehoiakim king of Judah into exile from Jerusalem to Babylon, along with all the nobles of Judah and Jerusalem—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yes, this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.27.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.27.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, the God of Israel, says about the things that are left in the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
